<DocLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="How ChayStore earns money from affiliate links and advertising, and how that does and does not influence our content." path="/affiliate-disclosure/" updated="2026-10-04">
  <p>In line with the U.S. Federal Trade Commission's guidance on endorsements, we want you to know how this site is funded.</p>
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>Some pages may contain affiliate links. If you click one and buy something, ChayStore may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. Affiliate links are marked with a disclosure near the first link on the page and carry <code>rel="sponsored nofollow"</code>.</p>
  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>We may show display ads in the future. Ads are labeled and are separate from editorial content.</p>
  <h2>Editorial independence</h2>
  <p>Commissions do not determine what we write or recommend. We do not accept payment for favorable coverage, and we do not publish fake reviews or ratings. Our buying guides explain what to look for; they are not hands-on lab tests unless stated.</p>
  <h2>Prices and availability</h2>
  <p>Prices and stock change. Always confirm the current price on the retailer's page before you buy.</p>
</DocLayout>
